                <head>AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE UNITED STATES AND THE FRENCH REPUBLIC WITH RESPECT TO
                    AMERICAN DEAD IN WORLD WAR II</head>
                <p>[For text of Agreement concerning the interment in France and in territories of
                    the French Union or the removal to the United States of the bodies of American
                    soldiers killed in the war of 1939–1945, signed at Paris, October 1, 1947, see
                    Department of State Treaties and Other International Acts Series (TIAS) No.
                    1720.]</p>
            </div>
